  "comment": "The sections of contracts/ whose cases the generated tests of every binding run (HR-100): scripts/binding-cases.mts writes each section as the group <group> of var/binding-cases/<source>, each parameter of the member from a field of a case and its result from the field result, and packages/rust/interface.json names the group in a row of cases. An argument is a field of the case, a field read as UTF-8 bytes, or the argument of the one call of the case, whose float is left out. A case with only goes to the group <group>_only_<targets>, which its row names in only. A case is left out when a field of skip is true, when it raises a kind that the binding decides, or when its call does not match.",
